WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:13.079 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; WHO THIS?

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:16.082 size:78% position:39%
&gt;&gt; LOOK AT THIS DUDE.
&gt;&gt; IS THAT MR. H.?

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:21.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
THAT'S MY TEACHER FROM SCHOOL.
WHAT HE DOING OUT HERE?

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.257
&gt;&gt; HEY.
I THOUGHT I MIGHT FIND YOU HERE.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:25.759
HAVEN'T SEEN YOU IN SCHOOL MUCH
LATELY.

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:28.161
&gt;&gt; YEAH, LET ME GUESS, YOU CAME
ALL THE WAY DOWN HERE TO BRING

00:00:28.161 --> 00:00:31.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
ME BACK, RIGHT?
WHAT'S THE POINT, MR. H.?

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:34.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU THINK I'M GOING TO BE SOME
BIG COLLEGE SUCCESS STORY?

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:38.304 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IS THAT SO CRAZY?
&gt;&gt; YOU'RE WATCHING TOO MANY

00:00:38.304 --> 00:00:41.441
MOVIES, DUDE.
BRAVE TEACHER COMES DOWN TO THE

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:45.111
HOOD TO SAVE HIS GIFTED STUDENT
FROM THE STREETS, RIGHT?

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.913
WHAT, NEXT I'M GOING TO HEAR,
MARCUS, YOU'VE GOT POTENTIAL.

00:00:46.913 --> 00:00:49.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YOU DO.
&gt;&gt; RIGHT, AND NEXT, MARCUS

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:51.251 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU'RE SMART?
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE SMART.

00:00:51.251 --> 00:00:56.456 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THEN IT'S LIKE, MARCUS,
YOU'RE A GENIUS.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:01:01.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
MARCUS, YOU'RE A GENIUS.

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:03.797 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AHH.
&gt;&gt; WHY CAN'T YOU SEE YOU'RE A

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:06.666 align:start size:94% position:6%
GENIUS, MARCUS?
&gt;&gt; GENIUS IS THROWN AROUND A

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:14.274
LITTLE TOO MUCH THESE DAYS.
BUT I WILL SAY YOU ARE VERY

00:01:14.274 --> 00:01:15.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
BRIGHT AND I BROUGHT YOU THIS.
IT'S YOUR S.A.T. RESULTS.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; MAN, I THREW THAT IN THE
TRASH.

00:01:17.811 --> 00:01:20.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AND I TOOK THEM OUT.
I THINK YOU OWE IT TO YOURSELF

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:23.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO SEE HOW YOU DID.
&gt;&gt; MAN, YOU OPEN IT.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:33.460
YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE THAT CARES.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
WELL, YOU GOT AN 880.
&gt;&gt; OUT OF 900?

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:38.898 align:start size:94% position:6%
HERE YOU GO.
OH, MARCUS, WHAT YOU DOING IN

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:43.036
THESE STREETS WHEN YOU GOT A
BASICALLY PERFECT S.A.T. SCORE?

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:45.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO, YOU DIDN'T.
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU KNOW ABOUT IT,

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
CRAIG?
&gt;&gt; I KNOW IT'S SCORED OUT

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:50.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
OF 1600, AND AN 880 IS, LIKE,
PRETTY BAD.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:54.481
&gt;&gt; SHUT UP, CRAIG.
WHEN YOU GONNA FACE IT, MR. H.?

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:56.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'M NOT YOUR 'HOOD TO HARVARD
SUCCESS STORY, ALL RIGHT?

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:59.119
&gt;&gt; NO, HARVARD IS DEFINITELY OUT
OF THE QUESTION.

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.954
BUT I THINK WITH A LITTLE
STUDYING, YOU CAN GET IT UP

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:03.323 align:start size:94% position:6%
TO 1100.
&gt;&gt; THAT'S STILL NOT THAT GOOD.

00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:06.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YES IT IS, TUNEE.
IT'S BETTER THAN ANYBODY ELSE

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:12.866 align:start size:94% position:6%
GOT OUT HERE.
&gt;&gt; I ACTUALLY GOT LIKE A 1260.

00:02:12.866 --> 00:02:14.234
&gt;&gt; WELL, YOU ARE BUYING WEED
RIGHT NOW, SO YOU CAN LEAVE.

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'M JUST WAITING FOR MY
CHANGE.

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:19.606
I GAVE YOU $100 10 MINUTES AGO,
AND YOU STILL HAVEN'T GIVEN ME

00:02:19.606 --> 00:02:23.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
CHANGE.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT, I GOT IT, MAN.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:26.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
$60 OF WEED --
&gt;&gt; ARE YOU USING A CALCULATOR

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
FOR THAT?
&gt;&gt; TAKE AWAY A HUNDRED --

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S 40.
&gt;&gt; GO SMOKE YOUR WEED, MAN.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; COME ON, MARCUS.
&gt;&gt; BULL SNAPS, BRO.

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:36.489
I MADE UP MY MIND, MR. H. I
DON'T KNOW WHY YOU BROUGHT YOUR

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:39.192 align:start size:94% position:6%
TIE AND YOUR SHIRT DOWN HERE,
MAN.

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:43.496
WHAT MORE DO YOU WANT FOR ME?
&gt;&gt; I WAS ACTUALLY HOPING TO

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
SCORE SOME SHROOMS.
I GOT A BACHELOR PARTY.

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:49.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
I PROMISED MY BUDDIES I'D PICK
UP SOME SHROOMS.

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
IF POSS, MAYBE GET THEM BEFORE
NEXT FRIDAY?

00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:55.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH, I THINK WE COULD DO
BUSINESS.

00:02:55.341 --> 00:02:57.677 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NAH.
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A TEST, RIGHT?

00:02:57.677 --> 00:03:00.713
YOU'RE TRYING TO MAKE ME LEARN?
&gt;&gt; NO, IT'S DEFINITELY NOT THAT,

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.116
I WANT TO TRY AND BUY SOME
SHROOMS, EITHER FROM YOU OR

00:03:03.116 --> 00:03:04.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
SOMEBODY YOU KNOW.
&gt;&gt; YEAH, MAN, COME THROUGH

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:09.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
TOMORROW.
&gt;&gt; ALL RIGHT.

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:14.894
MARCUS, HOPE TO SEE YOU IN CLASS
SOMETIME SOON.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:17.530 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YO, MR. H.
&gt;&gt; YEAH?

00:03:17.530 --> 00:03:20.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT DID THE GUIDANCE
COUNSELOR SAY?

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:22.235 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ABOUT WHAT?
&gt;&gt; AFTER YOU SHOWED HIM MY

00:03:22.235 --> 00:03:27.173
ESSAY, HE SAID SOMETHING TO YOU.
WHAT DID HE SAY?

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:34.314
&gt;&gt; HE SAID THAT IT WAS A LITTLE
ALL OVER THE PLACE.

00:03:34.314 --> 00:03:39.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; JUST LIKE ME.
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

